---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About | Airport Runways Live"
  description="Airport Runways Live is a directory of airport livestreams and a hosted plane-spotting channel based at Orlando MCO."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>Airport Runways Live</h1>
      <p>Airport Runways Live is a directory of airport livestreams and a hosted plane-spotting channel.</p>
      <p>
        We stream from Orlando International Airport (MCO) with Greater Orlando Aviation Authority spotting approval.
        We also stream Tampa (TPA) and Bogotá (BOG) when we’re there.
      </p>
      <p>
        This website lists other creators’ official YouTube lives. We do not rebroadcast their video. Watch on their
        channel so they keep the views and the Super Chats.
      </p>
      <p>
        Not affiliated with GOAA, MCO, TPA, El Dorado, any airline, YouTube, Flightradar24, or CamStreamer.
      </p>
      <p>English and Spanish speakers are welcome in our chat.</p>
      <p>
        Official MCO spotting:{' '}
        <a href="https://flymco.com/non-travelers/planespotting/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          flymco.com/non-travelers/planespotting/
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
